market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates", "excerpt": "Asian stocks edged higher while US equity-index futures slipped as investors weighed a leadership crisis at Nvidia Corp., the chipmaker at the heart of this year’s artificial-intelligence boom.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:08:05.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Taiwan Drafts Plans for Wealth Fund, Aims for Bill by Year-End", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-12/taiwan-drafts-plans-for-wealth-fund-aims-for-bill-by-year-end", "excerpt": "Taiwan is drafting legislation to establish a new sovereign wealth fund with initial capital of about NT$30 billion ($912 million), pushing ahead with the government’s plan to make strategic investments overseas.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T02:40:18.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "台湾正草拟立法设立新主权财富基金，初始资本约300亿新台币（约9.12亿美元），以推进政府海外战略投资计划，目标在年底前提出法案。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Chief Future Officer: Eimear Bonner, Chevron | Patience Sustains Progress", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-12/chief-future-officer-eimear-bonner-chevron-video", "excerpt": "Chief Financial Officers now play a critical role in shaping corporate strategy and positioning organizations to meet future challenges. This episode profiles Chevron CFO Eimear Bonner, who has helped lead the US energy giant to several of the most profitable quarters in its history -- and has taken", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T02:36:30.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "彭博节目「首席未来官」专访雪佛龙首席财务官Eimear Bonner，介绍其协助这家美国能源巨头实现历史上数个最赚钱季度的经历，并指出CFO在塑造企业战略中的作用。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "India Reclaims Spot Among World’s Five Biggest Stock Markets as Rally Extends", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-12/india-reclaims-spot-among-world-s-five-biggest-stock-markets-as-rally-extends", "excerpt": "Market value climbs to $5.4 trillion, overtaking Taiwan.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T02:30:33.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "随着涨势延续，印度股市市值升至5.4万亿美元，重新超过台湾，重返全球前五大股票市场之列。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "How Chevron Is Maintaining Prominence in the Permian Basin", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-12/how-chevron-is-maintaining-prominence-in-the-permian-video", "excerpt": "With nearly 2 million acres and an interest in one out of every five wells in the Permian Basin, Chevron has recently reached a production plateau and turned its focus to increasing reliability and efficiency in its West Texas operations. On Bloomberg Chief Future Officer, CFO Eimear Bonner shows An", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T02:30:29.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "雪佛龙在二叠纪盆地拥有近200万英亩资产，并参与当地每五口油井中的一口。近期产量进入平台期后，公司将重点转向提升西得州业务的可靠性与效率，CFO Eimear Bonner就此作介绍。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 12", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-11/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-12", "excerpt": "Oil fell toward a two-month low as Middle East production rose and hostilities between Iran and the US remained muted.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T23:04:06.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Mexican Steel Imports from Asia Fall as More US Supplies Sought", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-12/mexican-steel-imports-from-asia-fall-as-more-us-supplies-sought", "excerpt": "Mexico’s crackdown on Asian imports is creating an opening to buy more US-made steel, a top economic official said, a shift that could help advance trade negotiations with the Trump administration.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T01:42:20.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "墨西哥一名高级经济官员表示，墨西哥打击亚洲进口为增加采购美国钢材创造空间，此举可能有助于推进与特朗普政府的贸易谈判。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Nvidia Shares Slide as Investors Consider Future Without Huang", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-11/nvidia-tumbles-as-investors-consider-future-without-ceo-huang", "excerpt": "Nvidia Corp. shares sank in extended trading Wednesday as investors grappled with the possibility of the company without Chief Executive Officer Jensen Huang at the helm.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:48:40.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Sri Lanka Budget Targets Growth With IMF Bailout Nearing End", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-12/sri-lanka-budget-targets-growth-with-imf-bailout-nearing-end", "excerpt": "Sri Lanka will unveil a budget aimed at keeping its economic recovery on track amid global headwinds and as its $3 billion International Monetary Fund bailout draws to a close.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T01:30:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "斯里兰卡将公布预算，目标是在全球逆风下维持经济复苏。其30亿美元的国际货币基金组织救助计划即将结束。"}], "overview": "科技方面，谷歌DeepMind发布Gemini 4 Carbon模型，声称在网络安全与长程任务上达前沿水平；AlphaProof Code用Lean形式化验证Signal核心加密，完成三百万行证明；英伟达CEO黄仁勋婚外情事件持续发酵，董事会将决定其去留。财经方面，美国中期选举民主党大胜引发市场对AI基建放缓的担忧；印度股市市值回升至5.4万亿美元，重返全球前五；印尼盾跌至历史新低；台湾拟设立主权财富基金。时政方面，俄乌美三方会谈仅就大规模交换战俘达成一致，未获重大突破；以军空袭加沙纳赛尔医院致至少6死20伤；美国密西西比州选出140多年来首位黑人参议员。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股技术面分化：AAPL以RSI 60.4、MACD金叉及距52周高-0.08%的多头排列偏强，SPY与QQQ则在SMA20下方横盘（RSI 49.9/46.1、MACD红柱），NVDA RSI 28.7超卖、5日跌13.19%显弱势。加密整体偏空，加密恐慌贪婪指数28处恐慌，总市值2.47T、24h -2.64%，BTC主导率59.8%，BTC现价73642.88低于SMA20的77683、RSI 34.3，ETH RSI 30、MACD死叉，SOL RSI 24.2超卖。中概普遍空头排列：BABA、0700.HK、PDD均SMA空头，仅JD在SMA20上方、RSI 57.2相对抗跌。商品外汇方面，黄金空头排列且逼近52周低，WTI原油RSI 36.8承压，美元指数RSI 63.7、MACD金叉偏强，VIX单日-10.12%回落至17.49、MACD死叉，10Y收益率5%贴近SMA20。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "NVDA", "display_name": "英伟达 (NVDA)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "现价173.73美元，单日反弹2.87%但5日累计下跌13.19%，距52周高-28.61%。RSI14仅28.7处超卖区，MACD为-12.